<title>USA: Medical Graphics names new executives.</title>
<headline>Medical Graphics names new executives.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Graphics Corp said Thursday it named Dale Johnson as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Johnson replaces Lawrence Laster, who has left the company, Medical Graphics said.</p>
<p>The company also named Stephen Anderson to the newly created position of chief technology officer. He most recently served as chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Rex Fasching, who joined the company as a consultant earlier this year, was promoted to chief operating officer, Medical Graphics said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
